============================================================

This is the primary feature.

Use noVNC.

Create a proper VNC viewer.

Features:

- connect
- disconnect
- reconnect
- fullscreen
- fit-to-screen
- scale
- resize
- mouse input
- keyboard input
- Ctrl
- Alt
- Escape
- Windows/Super key
- function keys
