Toolbar:

[Reconnect]
[Ctrl]
[Alt]
[Esc]
[Paste]
[Copy]
[Fit]
[Fullscreen]

The VNC viewer should occupy most of the workspace.

Do not build a fake VNC screen.

It must actually connect to a VNC server.

============================================================
11. VNC WEBSOCKET PROXY
============================================================

Implement backend VNC WebSocket proxying.

Expected architecture:

Browser
   |
WebSocket
   |
Node backend
   |
WebSocket proxy
   |
VNC server

Do not require the browser to know the actual internal VNC address if the backend can safely proxy it.

Validate:
- authenticated user
- server ID
- authorization
- VNC destination
before opening the connection.

Prevent arbitrary host/port proxying from user-controlled input.

