============================================================
19. ERROR HANDLING
============================================================

This is important.

Handle:

- server offline
- SSH authentication failure
- VNC authentication failure
- timeout
- connection refused
- WebSocket disconnect
- invalid credentials
- SFTP errors
- file upload failure
- permission denied
- server unavailable

Give useful messages.

Bad:

"Something went wrong."

Good:

"SSH connection failed: authentication rejected by the server."

Never leak:
- private keys
- passwords
- internal stack traces
- sensitive connection information

============================================================
20. LOGGING
============================================================

